author: cdvankammen
date: 2026-10-23 16:56:11 -0600
subject: fix(tests): security-audit path.resolve CWD → ROOT

The test file used path.resolve('src/...') which resolves relative to
CWD. When vitest runs from tests/, this resolves to tests/src/...
(doesn't exist). Added ROOT constant pointing to repo root and updated
all 13 path.resolve calls to use ROOT as the base.


